@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180
@sessionCookie = __Host-edufix.auth=replace-with-your-session-cookie

### Public CAPTCHA configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/captcha-config
Accept: application/json

### Private shop page (requires an authenticated browser session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loja.html
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Shop catalog, balance, and inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shop/
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Accept: application/json

### Purchase an item with coins
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shop/purchase
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "extra-life"
}
